{"id":"memorial_103903","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103900","label":"Call Logs · Deep within the Crystal Region"},"label":"010.smi","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_103902","next":"memorial_103904","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103903_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"(Original file damaged. Only subtitles remain.)"},{"id":"memorial_103903_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"There's something by the entrance that's made of glass."},{"id":"memorial_103903_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"A mirror, maybe?"},{"id":"memorial_103903_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"The further I go in, the more of them I see."},{"id":"memorial_103903_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"They seem to become more intricate as well."},{"id":"memorial_103903_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"In fact, they're more like shields instead of mirrors."},{"id":"memorial_103903_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_39_03_description","text":"... I'm going to venture in further."}]}